Package: mudi-volte-i18n-@LANG@
Version: @VERSION@-1
Depends: mudi-volte
Provides: luci-i18n-mudi-volte-@LANG@
Source: MudiVoLTE
License: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
Section: luci
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: @LANGNAME@ texts for mudi-volte (VoLTE calls on the GL.iNet Mudi 7).
 The LuCI page, the page in the GL admin panel, the command line tool with its
 setup, and the app on the router's screen (MudiScreen) in @LANGNAME@. The
 first install sets mudi-volte.main.lang to @LANG@ unless a language is set;
 LuCI and MudiScreen follow their own language settings.
